  "instructions": [
    "Heat sesame oil in a medium pot over medium heat.",
    "Add minced ginger and garlic and sauté until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "Stir in confit tomato and cook until the mixture is aromatic.",
    "Pour in vegetable stock and bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Add soy sauce, rice vinegar, chili flakes, salt, and pepper, stirring well.",
    "Gently fold in tofu cubes and let the stew simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Add heavy cream and continue simmering, allowing the broth to thicken slightly, about 5 minutes.",
    "Sprinkle toasted sesame seeds, garnish with scallions if desired, and serve hot."
